msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For most of my life, I was cursed. Irregular. And you were the only one who ⟪k:3⟫"
"didn’t⟪k:4⟫ treat me like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Durante a maior parte da minha vida, fui amaldiçoado. Anormal. E você foi a única "
"que ⟪k:3⟫não⟪k:4⟫ me tratou assim."

